menu "Homey inventory experiments"

config PATCH117Q_HOMEY_DEVICES_FRESH_TRANSPORT
    bool "Close Homey transport before Devices inventory request (Patch117Q experiment)"
    default n
    help
        Close the existing Homey HTTP client's current connection after Zones
        succeeds and before the single Devices GET. The next perform uses the
        same endpoint and session but establishes a new HTTPS/TLS connection.
        This is an experiment, not a production transport policy change.

endmenu
